SUMMARY:Bulls on the Beach
DESCRIPTION:Flora-Bama turns its beach into a professional bull-riding are
 na for three nights\, September 10 through 12. Thursday is Camo Cowboy an
 d Kid's Night with a coloring-contest bike giveaway\, Friday carries a Pa
 triotic Tribute theme\, and Saturday closes with 90s Country. Admission i
